form, FCEV solution, and vehicle control unit. It provides vehicle OS comprising E/E architecture, and middle development and integration services; cloud, edge analytics, and data management; and vehicle engineering and design. In addition, the company offers virtual engineering, integrated diagnostic and aftersales transformation, and validation. The company was formerly known as KPIT Engineering Limited and changed its name to KPIT Technologies Limited in March 2019. KPIT Technologies Limited was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in Pune, India."}}